<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Page Not Found | Airbnb</title>
    <link href="/output.css" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-slate-950 text-slate-100">
    <main class="relative isolate flex min-h-screen items-center justify-center overflow-hidden px-6 py-12">
      <div class="absolute -left-24 -top-24 -z-10 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-sky-500/20 blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-32 -right-20 -z-10 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/20 blur-3xl"></div>

      <section class="w-full max-w-xl text-center">
        <div class="mx-auto mb-8 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl border border-sky-400/30 bg-sky-400/10 shadow-2xl shadow-sky-950/50">
          <svg class="h-10 w-10 text-sky-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.75 9.75h.008v.008H9.75V9.75Zm4.5 0h.008v.008h-.008V9.75ZM8.25 15a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 7.5 0M3.75 12a8.25 8.25 0 1 0 16.5 0 8.25 8.25 0 0 0-16.5 0Z" />
          </svg>
        </div>

        <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-sky-300">Error 404</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl">This page wandered off.</h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-md text-base leading-7 text-slate-400 sm:text-lg">
          The place you are looking for is unavailable or may have moved. Let us get you back to browsing homes.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="/" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-sky-400 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-950 shadow-lg shadow-sky-950/40 transition hover:bg-sky-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-sky-300 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-slate-950 sm:w-auto">
            Back to homes
          </a>
          <button type="button" onclick="history.back()" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/70 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-200 transition hover:border-slate-500 hover:bg-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-slate-950 sm:w-auto">
            Go back
          </button>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-slate-500">Airbnb stays are better when the address is right.</p>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
